Package: com.ratush.claude-code-ios
Name: Claude Code iOS (NewTerm launcher)
Version: 2.1.112-4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: ratu.sh
Author: Anthropic (CLI); original iOS package by CyPwn/Bryan; repack by ba31k; NewTerm ssh launcher by ratu.sh
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), zsh, ldid, openssh
Conflicts: xyz.cypwn.claude-code, io.github.ba31k.claude-code-ios
Replaces: xyz.cypwn.claude-code, io.github.ba31k.claude-code-ios
Provides: claude-code
Description: Claude Code CLI on jailbroken iOS. Launches NewTerm 3 through its supported ssh:// scheme instead of the broken newterm3:// URL, so tapping the home-screen app starts Claude Code. Based on the last JS release (2.1.112), bundled iOS Node with V8 JIT off, and iOS-patched ripgrep.
Homepage: https://github.com/chelaxian/claude-code-ios
